    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up this cool space by launching furniture in wild and creative ways! Earn <i>style points</i> with epic bank shots, jaw-dropping combo throws, blazing fast tosses, long-distance launches, and more. Craving an adrenaline rush? Take on <i>speed run mode</i> and race to complete your setup in record time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the art pieces in the right places with a painting-shooting gun. But beware\u2014drones are on the loose, swooping in with furniture pieces and turning your setup into a thrilling test of strategy and reflexes! Climb the leader boards by setting the fastest time or racking up the most dazzling style score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s the kicker: it\u2019s also a memory game! Hunt down hidden furniture scattered throughout the house. Can you conquer the chaos, unlock your creativity, and put it all back together?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up this cool space by launching furniture in wild and creative ways! Earn <i>style points</i> with epic bank shots, jaw-dropping combo throws, blazing fast tosses, long-distance launches, and more. Craving an adrenaline rush? Take on <i>speed run mode</i> and race to complete your setup in record time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the art pieces in the right places with a painting-shooting gun. But beware\u2014drones are on the loose, swooping in with furniture pieces and turning your setup into a thrilling test of strategy and reflexes! Climb the leader boards by setting the fastest time or racking up the most dazzling style score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s the kicker: it\u2019s also a memory game! Hunt down hidden furniture scattered throughout the house. Can you conquer the chaos, unlock your creativity, and put it all back together?</p>",
    "short_description": "Furniture Toss is a memory game with a creative edge! Search a cool place for hidden furniture and place it with flair. Earn bonus points for creative throws like bank shots, combos, and long-distance launches. Combine strategy and skill to turn chaos into style!",
